        -:   35:/**
        -:   36: * Multivector container type.
        -:   37: *
        -:   38: * Keeps items segregated by their type in multiple ptr_vectors. Provides both
        -:   39: * access as a flat list as well as access by type of item.
        -:   40: *
        -:   41: * T is the stored type, needs to provide Type() method used to segregate items.
        -:   42: * FIRST_TYPE_VAL is the lower boundary value of the types stored in the container.
        -:   43: * LAST_TYPE_VAL is the upper boundary value of the types stored in the container.
        -:   44: */
        -:   45:template<typename T, int FIRST_TYPE_VAL, int LAST_TYPE_VAL>
